### Add Data

What to test:

- Click Add Data repeatedly; new candles append to the right and the axis extends without disturbing existing candles.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Candlestick Animation Add Data" name="candlestick-animation-add-data" type="generated" /%}

### Remove Data

What to test:

- Click Remove Data repeatedly; the last candle is removed and the axis contracts smoothly.

